From 472b149661d72b412faa0663925813cb979bb758 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: geoca <geoca@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:31:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Input: mshw0485_touch - add valley-verified merged-finger
 split and bezel edge-palm guard

When two close fingers merge into one connected capacitive component,
partition the component via Voronoi assignment around strong local
maxima separated by at least 2 sensor cells (~8 mm) with at least a
15% capacitive valley between peaks so close pinches separate cleanly
while flat palms and single fingertips stay unsplit. Add a bezel
edge-palm guard rejecting wide (>= 7 cell) or heavy unclassified edge
grips while preserving narrow bezel swipes.
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/mshw0485_touch.c | 349 ++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 305 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

